Of the 24 cases, three are for homicides. Ilias Lasley, 29, of Ankeny, is facing two counts of first-degree murder for the deaths of Marshalltown residents Maria Murillo and Frances Tillie Gasca. The double homicide occurred in April north of Marshalltown. It is alleged Lasley became upset that they were speaking in Spanish and then shot them both. He is also charged with two counts of dominion or control of a firearm or weapon by a felon.
